{"parse": {"title": "太阳的背面-08", "pageid": 84874, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%8C%E9%9D%A2-07\" title=\"太阳的背面-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">太阳的背面-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">太阳的背面</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.86.8D.E8.A7.81.EF.BC.8C.E6.9C.8B.E5.8F.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"再见，朋友\">再见，朋友</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 再见，朋友</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Goodbye. Friend</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2350108</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>拿到了金牌之后，你接受了采访，有了专栏，成为了风头无两的人物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>可那又怎么样呢？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_guzhai1\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_guzhai1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_guzhai1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-618320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-618320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-618320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子：</div><div><i>妈妈，那是夏洛特的屋子，她很久没有……</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-503401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-503401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-503401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女人：</div><div><i>别说出她的名字——她是女巫！说出她的名字只会让你招致灾祸。</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>没有人愿意谈论你的名字，也没有人愿意经过你门前的小径。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你的花园再也没有花朵开放，杂草长遍了每一寸荒芜的角落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>这不可能！为什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>因为战争追上了你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>战争……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>是的，你还没见到——不过你总会见到的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>战争摧毁了你的故乡。你跟随家人一起搬到了一处民居。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>理论上这是一个安全的地方，你听信了别人的话语，坚信交战的双方不会对这里开火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……这不是很好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你还记得那一天吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>那一天？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>是的，那一天……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>以现在的标准来看，那一天算不上一个好日子，到处都是硝烟的味道。军队在附近投掷了太多的炸弹，四处都是废墟与尘埃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>但至少，你的居住地还未经炮火洗礼。你得以在战争中苟全自身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>然后呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>抬头看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩抬起头——一轮金灿灿的太阳，她不可思议地望着眼前的一切，随后揉了揉眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我怎么会在训练室里看到太阳……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiaoshulin_zao\"><img alt=\"jiaoshulin_zao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png/600px-Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png/900px-Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png/1200px-Cg-jiaoshulin_zao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>那一天，你也在天空上看到了类似的太阳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>久候不至的和平似乎终于要到来——因为你已经很久没有听到飞机的轰鸣了，荒芜的草地上，似乎有了生命的影子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>于是，在那片空旷的焦土上，你开始了舞蹈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>……盛日之眼，平衡的守护者，你是无尽之泉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>疗愈的苏利丝，闪耀的苏利丝，神圣的苏利丝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你还记得“自由祭祀”的由来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>当然，我记得——“自由祭祀”来源于古老的祭祀仪式。远古的巫祝为了避免纷争而进行舞蹈，请求苏利丝的眷顾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>可以说，它最初是祈求和平的舞蹈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>那个时候，你也是这么想的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你看见了闪光的太阳，土壤由贫瘠变得丰沃，细嫩的绿芽破土而出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>这是你此生最成功的舞蹈，苏利丝第一次回应了你的祈求——从来没有人能在乌卢鲁的赛场上做到这些，即使是当初的你也不行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你第一次听到了某种尖锐的哨声——当然，以后你还有很多回顾的机会，因为它会在你的噩梦中永无止息地出现，就像阿拉克尼那张永远织不完的网。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>很快，一枚炮弹在你的身边爆炸了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-628910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-628910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-628910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你因此失去了自己的腿——很可惜，你最后还是没有得到神明的眷顾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>可怜的人，她的信仰从此变成了一个笑话——如果献祭一切只能获得这样的结果，这所谓的神明最好还是从未存在过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>这也是你之后每一个日夜痛苦的根源——一个不相信神的人，怎么能再次获得神明的垂青呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她露出了讥嘲的冷笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>不可能……苏利丝是我的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>可怜的小东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>看看你胸口的奖牌吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩托起了那枚金牌，上面有一个小小的凹痕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-628911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-628911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-628911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-310412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-310412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-310412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你记得这个缺口吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-628911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-628911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-628911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>这不是我的金牌！我的金牌绝不会有这样的痕迹……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>在腿断掉之后，你用力把它扔了出去，含泪赌咒再也不要看到它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>很可惜，诅咒没有生效。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-628914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-628914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-628914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_at_duitan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_at_duitan1\"><img alt=\"2_3_at_duitan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-2_3_at_duitan1.png/600px-Cg-2_3_at_duitan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-2_3_at_duitan1.png/900px-Cg-2_3_at_duitan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/Cg-2_3_at_duitan1.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_at_duitan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门外响起了一阵敲门声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-310520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-310520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-310520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>您好，有人在吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-310520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-310520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-310520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>女巫小姐？这是这周的蜗牛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是一个陌生的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>夏洛特，我是来向你告别的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>因为我的蜗牛到了——如果我不去开门，那个小东西会一直等下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>一分钟，十分钟，一个小时……谁知道呢，小东西的想法很奇怪，谁也不知道她会在门口等多久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>所以我必须去开门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我还能见到您吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-310412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-310412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-310412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>如果可以的话，我希望你永远不要遇见我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女人摇了摇头，随后露出无奈的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>可是我们总会遇见的，夏洛特。许多结局并不经由人的选择而产生，也无法因为人的意志而改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>我想，现在正是说再见的时候——保管好这块金牌，别迁怒它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女人离开了这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的行走姿态僵硬而局促，腿部发出了古怪的摩擦声。但脖颈依旧挺得笔直，就像一只黑色的天鹅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_at_dudugu1\"><img alt=\"2_3_at_dudugu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png/600px-Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png/900px-Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>女巫小姐，这是这周的蜗牛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那只装满蜗牛的洋铁桶被一只苍白消瘦的手接过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……你的报酬在门口的邮筒里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>还有，谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>……天哪，女巫小姐，你说了什么？你说了谢谢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>我从来没有听你说过这个词，你真的是女巫小姐吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_fangjian\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_fangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她照旧把蜗牛摆在了桌面上，它们逐渐从壳中伸出了柔软的脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每周一次的田径比赛还在继续，经过漫长的等待，第三只蜗牛率先抵达了终点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>最后的获胜者是……3号选手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>你赢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她收集了蜗牛留下的黏液，将它们熬煮成一锅淡黄色的膏脂——是的，这些应该足够在这次行程中使用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女巫正在收拾行李，她已经太久没出过远门了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>澳大利亚……那里的太阳很厉害，也许我该带一个更大的帽子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>还有更多的润滑脂……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>噢！还有这个……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看到了那个小小的匣子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>里面装着那块金灿灿的奖牌，上面有着一个小小的凹陷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/HeadIconSmall-310410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鲜花、掌声、欢呼、润滑脂、金灿灿的太阳，以及一千道影子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻轻地吻了吻奖牌的缺角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>晚安，我的朋友。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "太阳的背面-08"}}